Package: timeProtState
Type: Package
Title: Contrast-Aware Dynamic State Analysis for Time-Course Proteomics
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-08-05
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Given", family = "Family",
           email = "maintainer@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Provides an auditable framework for shared-baseline,
    multi-condition time-course proteomics experiments. The package
    constructs estimable contrast families from a saturated group-means
    design, decomposes protein-level temporal and condition-dependent
    evidence into transparent axes, and computes permutation-calibrated
    directional and remodeling pathway states. Includes trajectory
    clustering, simulation for benchmarks, and structured export.
